 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-2469) 'Reveal XLA's accumulation tree for each reduce and dot shape the five graphs use, on the Zen 2 desk with this jax build, and record the trees in a table keyed by shape. Emit each tree as a sequence of slices and adds, or as a kernel that takes the tree as data, and fall back to today's order, with the case kept in XFAIL, for any shape the table does not cover. The table is tied to one CPU and one XLA build, the way rsqrt_zen2 already is, so it records both.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2469  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-2469) 'The eight cases
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
