 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-2469) 'dot_batched, mlp_pre, mlp_f32, reduce_sum_random, mean_last, softmax_f32, rms_norm_f32 and causal_attention: each is within the functional bar today, a rel-L2 around 1e-7 and at most a few dozen ulp, but not bit-equal. pinned_sum_tree, softmax_pinned and causal_softmax_pinned already pin the order and are already bit-equal, which is the evidence that order, not arithmetic, is the whole gap.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2469  1 LINE
 Text:Written

